{"tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.h1_text.wedding_alcohol_calculator.c45e196c":"婚礼酒水计算器","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.p_text.how_much_wine_beer_and_spirits_do_you_ac.82048b04":"葡萄酒、啤酒和烈酒到底要准备多少？行业通用标准是每位宾客每小时饮用 1 杯——据此可生成一份按瓶、按箱采购的清单。","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.a_text.home.8cf04a97":"家","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.a_text.free_tools.c746326b":"免费工具","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.h2_text.your_reception.56171e6a":"婚宴到场人数","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.label_text.guests_who_drink.be6a6afc":"饮酒宾客人数","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.label_text.bar_open_hours.12f32e06":"酒吧开放时间（小时）","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.label_text.drinks_per_guest_per_hour.630e62e2":"每位宾客每小时饮用杯数","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.option_text.1_standard_the_general_rule.5d87e961":"1 — 标准（通用规则）","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.option_text.1_2_lively_crowd.14c2788e":"1.2 — 热闹聚会","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.option_text.1_5_big_night.169d562b":"1.5 — 狂欢之夜","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.option_text.0_8_daytime_light.0cbd5477":"0.8 — 白天 / 少量饮酒","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.label_text.drink_mix.985982b4":"酒水搭配","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.option_text.balanced_50_wine_30_beer_20_spirits.f4f8bc04":"均衡型 50% 葡萄酒 / 30% 啤酒 / 20% 烈酒","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.option_text.mostly_wine_70_15_15.c200e7f6":"以葡萄酒为主 70 / 15 / 15","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.option_text.mostly_beer_25_60_15.d539866d":"以啤酒为主 25 / 60 / 15","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.option_text.wine_beer_only_60_40_0.43b245c6":"仅葡萄酒和啤酒 60 / 40 / 0","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.label_text.bottle_standard.64030c13":"瓶装容量标准","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.option_text.us_750ml_wine_12oz_beer_1_5oz_shot.4fe2ef2f":"美国 — 750ml葡萄酒、12oz啤酒、1.5oz烈酒","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.option_text.au_750ml_wine_375ml_cans_700ml_spirits.df862d2c":"澳大利亚 — 750ml葡萄酒、375ml罐装酒、700ml烈酒","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.span_text.include_one_glass_of_bubbles_each_for_th.005ef7de":"每位宾客准备1杯起泡酒，用于祝酒","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.span_text.add_a_10_safety_buffer.33b89e7f":"增加10%的安全余量","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.h2_text.what_to_buy.bdd9c872":"购买清单","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.p_text.0_of_0_done.c7d9bf0c":"0 / 0 已完成","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.button_text.copy_result.76cfa6f1":"复制结果","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.button_text.download_txt.5f29b5ba":"下载 .txt","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.button_text.print_pdf.963ace37":"打印 / PDF","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.button_text.another_version.647b4bc0":"另一个版本","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.button_text.reset.526d688f":"重置","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.h2_text.the_rule_behind_every_wedding_bar_calcul.3ace06cf":"每个婚礼酒水计算器背后的规则","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.span_text.ranked_us_tools_wedbuild_calculator_city.88468bca":"美国排名靠前的工具（WedBuild、Calculator City，以及它们引用的餐饮指南）都采用同一条规划原则：","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.strong_text.one_drink_per_drinking_guest_for_every_h.edc9314e":"酒吧每营业一个小时，需为每位饮酒宾客准备一杯饮品","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.span_text.rising_to_two_or_three_for_a_crowd_that.65fe26fc":"，对于喜欢畅饮一番的宾客群体，可提高到二或三杯。这个数字随后会按葡萄酒、啤酒和烈酒进行分配，并换算为采购单位。我们的默认方案——100位饮酒宾客，酒水供应五小时——共计500杯饮品，恰好与排名第一的页面采用的演算示例一致。","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.span_text.two_details_matter_more_than_the_arithme.cfacfb54":"两个细节比计算更重要。首先，统计","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.strong_text.drinkers_not_invitations.afa05f59":"饮酒人数，而非受邀人数","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.span_text.children_drivers_and_guests_who_do_not_d.688834b6":"：儿童、指定司机和不饮酒的宾客都不计入，异地婚礼或周日下午举办的婚礼用量通常也会更低。第二，在购买任何东西之前，先确认场地已经提供哪些酒水——许多餐饮套餐都包含酒水服务，有些场地则禁止外带酒水。","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.h2_text.standard_pours_used_here_us.6654a360":"本文采用的标准饮用份量（美国）","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.th_text.drink.40491db1":"饮品","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.th_text.one_serving.6dfa3b34":"单份用量","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.th_text.servings_per_bottle_case.25b69c8f":"每瓶 / 每箱可供份数","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.td_text.wine.b9eadba3":"葡萄酒","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.td_text.5_oz_150_ml.81cce3a6":"5 盎司（150 毫升）","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.td_text.5_per_750_ml_bottle.d10354f6":"每750 ml瓶可倒5杯","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.td_text.beer.c6884357":"啤酒","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.td_text.12_oz_can_or_bottle.b1dd7db8":"12 oz罐装或瓶装","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.td_text.24_per_case.69ae4521":"每箱 24 份","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.td_text.spirits.076d1592":"烈酒","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.td_text.1_5_oz_shot.3f4c916a":"1.5 oz烈酒","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.td_text.16_per_750_ml_bottle.5407df4e":"每 750 毫升瓶 16 个","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.td_text.sparkling_toast.26cf683b":"起泡（吐司）","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.td_text.5_oz_glass.cb07cab9":"5盎司玻璃","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.p_text.the_pour_definitions_match_the_us_nation.006b70dd":"倒酒定义符合美国国家酒精滥用和酒精中毒研究所的标准饮酒指南，领先的计算器也引用了该指南。如果您在澳大利亚购买，请改用 AU 标准：375 毫升罐装和 700 毫升酒精瓶会显着改变包装数学。","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.h2_text.worked_example_100_guests_five_hours.a0c29cea":"工作示例：100 位客人，5 小时","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.span_text.at_one_drink_per_hour_with_a_balanced_50.8aa63ab1":"每小时喝一杯，均衡分配 50/30/20，购物清单接近","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.strong_text.50_bottles_of_wine_7_cases_of_beer_and_5.a1502d5b":"50瓶葡萄酒、7箱啤酒和5瓶烈酒","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.span_text.plus_about_20_bottles_of_sparkling_wine.020a8e35":"，如果每位客人都得到一杯敬酒，再加上大约20瓶起泡酒。添加10%，就不会短缺；未开封的箱子通常可以退回，因此犯错的高成本很少。","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.h2_text.planning_the_rest_of_the_reception.b3bc12d3":"规划其余的接待工作","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.span_text.alcohol_is_only_one_line_in_the_catering.be14277c":"酒精只是餐饮对话中的一句台词。将此与","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.a_text.cake_serving_calculator.3c051ce8":"蛋糕服务计算器","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.span_text.for_dessert_portions_the.b3339ce2":"对于甜点部分，","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.a_text.guest_count_calculator.2b2fff97":"宾客人数计算器","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.span_text.to_firm_up_the_headcount_before_rsvps_ar.3e9a4cfc":"在回复到达之前确定人数，并且","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.a_text.budget_calculator.060f44a9":"预算计算器","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.span_text.to_see_how_the_bar_sits_against_the_tota.0a5bfa74":"看看条形图与总数的关系如何。这些是购买估计，而不是消费指导——提供食物、水和良好的非酒精选择，并确保每个人都有安全回家的路。","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.h2_text.frequently_asked_questions.af2a4d28":"常见问题","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.summary_text.how_much_alcohol_do_i_need_for_100_weddi.d3b0b66c":"100 名婚礼宾客需要多少酒精？","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.p_text.at_one_drink_per_guest_per_hour_over_a_f.b7106351":"在 5 小时的招待会上，每位客人每小时喝一杯，计划 500 杯。均衡的 50% 葡萄酒/30% 啤酒/20% 烈酒的比例约为 50 瓶葡萄酒、7 箱啤酒和 5 瓶烈酒，如果每个人都敬酒的话，再加上大约 20 瓶起泡酒。","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.summary_text.how_many_drinks_per_guest_per_hour_shoul.8da34564":"我应该为每位客人每小时喝多少杯？","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.p_text.one_per_hour_is_the_standard_planning_ru.30873211":"每小时一次是标准的计划规则。白天或少量饮酒的人群使用 0.8，热闹的夜晚使用 1.2，大型聚会使用 1.5。这个数字只是一个购买预估，并不是任何人的消费目标。","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.summary_text.should_i_count_every_invited_guest.ddbca9ca":"所有受邀宾客都要计入吗？","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.p_text.no_count_the_guests_who_will_actually_dr.87d585b6":"不用。只统计真正会喝酒的宾客——儿童、指定司机和不饮酒者不计入。美国关于出席回复的指引还显示，本地受邀宾客中有80–85%会到场，目的地婚礼的出席比例则更低，因此请从合理的预计到场人数开始计算。","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.summary_text.what_is_a_standard_drink_pour.85968b71":"标准单杯酒水的分量是多少？","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.p_text.in_the_us_5_oz_of_wine_12_oz_of_beer_or.8cfcc490":"在美国：5 盎司葡萄酒、12 盎司啤酒或 1.5 盎司烈酒。一瓶 750 毫升的葡萄酒瓶可容纳约 5 杯啤酒，一箱可容纳 24 杯啤酒，一瓶 750 毫升的烈酒瓶可容纳约 16 杯啤酒。计算器使用这些转换并始终向上舍入。","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.summary_text.do_i_need_sparkling_wine_for_the_toast.ff20af3c":"祝酒时需要准备起泡酒吗？","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.p_text.only_if_you_are_serving_a_toast_pour_to.d6f026e8":"只有在你要给每位宾客都倒一杯用于祝酒时才适用。每位宾客5 oz，即每5位饮酒宾客需1瓶750 ml葡萄酒。许多宴会场地会直接用常规葡萄酒订单里的酒来作祝酒酒，因此请先查看餐饮套餐。","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.summary_text.can_i_bring_my_own_alcohol_to_the_venue.f2058b33":"我可以自带酒水到婚礼场地吗？","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.p_text.sometimes_many_us_venues_allow_self_supp.7533efd4":"有时可以。许多美国场地允许自带酒水，但会收取开瓶费；另一些场地则要求购买场地提供的持牌酒水套餐。购买前请以书面形式确认相关规定——这个计算器可以算出你还需要补上的差额。","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.h2_text.more_free_wedding_tools.511ec8cc":"更多免费婚礼工具","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.a_text.budget_calculator.4a2217e0":"预算计算器","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.a_text.seating_chart.0aa1b5db":"座位表","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.a_text.hashtag_generator.f0d774ee":"话题标签生成器","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.a_text.invitation_maker.eaa060de":"请柬制作工具","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.a_text.save_the_date.f3ad2c82":"婚期预告","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.a_text.photo_book_planner.a9887dd0":"照片书策划师","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.a_text.photo_collage.942e207a":"照片拼贴","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.a_text.heic_to_jpg.67ca8d18":"HEIC 转 JPG","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.a_text.planning_checklist.8d9c7c04":"婚礼筹备清单","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.a_text.vow_writer.90e3a3d2":"婚礼誓词撰写工具","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.a_text.speech_writer.7bd24d35":"致辞撰写","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.a_text.guest_count_calculator.3713f2ea":"宾客人数计算器","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.a_text.day_of_timeline.caa789f5":"婚礼当天流程表","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.h2_text.planning_done_let_s_make_the_film.acbc362d":"筹备完成了吗？来拍一部婚礼电影吧。","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.p_text.turn_the_photos_and_words_from_your_plan.8830dc77":"将您计划中的照片和文字变成 60-90 秒的电影婚礼影片。","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.a_text.get_a_free_quote.076af0bf":"免费估价 →","tools.wedding-alcohol-calculator.button_text.save_pdf.71ddc50b":"保存.pdf"}